---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import ContributionOptions from "../../components/contribution/ContributionOptions.astro";
---

<MainLayout
    title="Contribute | The River Kept Flowing"
    description="Support the mission, community work, creations, and services of The River Kept Flowing."
    stylesheet="/contribute.css"
>

<main data-pagefind-body class="contribute-page">


<section class="contribute-hero">

    <div class="contribute-shell">

        <p class="section-label">
            Contribute to the River
        </p>

        <h1>
            Help build something that lasts.
        </h1>

        <p>
            The River Kept Flowing exists to create, teach, serve,
            and care for people through practical action.
        </p>

        <p>
            Every contribution helps provide resources,
            create opportunities, and continue the work.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>



<section class="contribute-options">

    <div class="contribute-shell">

        <h2>
            Ways to participate
        </h2>

        <ContributionOptions />

    </div>

</section>



<section
    id="support"
    class="contribute-section"
>

<div class="contribute-shell">

<h2>
Where contributions go
</h2>

<p>
Contribution support is organized through The River Fund, where the purpose
of the work and intended use of resources are explained
before any contribution is made.
</p>

<p>
The goal is transparency: resources received should create real
impact through creation, service, and community care.
</p>

</div>

</section>



<section
    id="community"
    class="contribute-section"
>

<div class="contribute-shell">

<h2>
Feed the community
</h2>

<p>
Community support is intended to help provide meals,
resources, and direct care for people who need practical help.
</p>

</div>

</section>



<section
    id="products"
    class="contribute-section"
>

<div class="contribute-shell">

<h2>
Products and creations
</h2>

<p>
Products, guides, and other creations give people another way
to participate by supporting something tangible.
</p>

<p>
<a href="/shop/">Explore the shop &rarr;</a>
</p>

</div>

</section>



<section
    id="services"
    class="contribute-section"
>

<div class="contribute-shell">

<h2>
Work with The River
</h2>

<p>
The River now offers coaching, consulting, digital foundations,
and practical guidance built from experience.
</p>

<p>
<a href="/services/">Explore services &rarr;</a>
</p>

</div>

</section>



<section
    id="partners"
    class="contribute-section"
>

<div class="contribute-shell">

<h2>
Partner with The River
</h2>

<p>
Organizations and businesses aligned with the mission
can participate through partnerships and collaborations.
</p>

<p>
<a href="/partner/">Explore partnerships &rarr;</a>
</p>

</div>

</section>



</main>

</MainLayout>